      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Chatswood grew after the North Shore railway opened in 1890 and the Harbour Bridge in 1932.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chatswood%2C_New_South_Wales",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Chatswood station served as a junction until 2009, when the Epping‑Chatswood line joined the metro network.",
